WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.140
Monday morning. Two friends talk about their days off.

2
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:07.750
Co robiłeś w weekend?

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.560
Byłem w górach z bratem. A ty?

4
00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:15.870
He is a man, so his verb ends in e m.

5
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.400
Ja byłam w domu i czytałam książkę.

6
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:24.990
She is a woman: listen, her verbs end in a m.

7
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.140
Wczoraj byłem w kinie.

8
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.060
In the past tense, the ending shows who is speaking.

9
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:39.570
A man's form and a woman's form differ by one vowel.

10
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:48.130
Kasia asks Piotr what he did on Saturday and Sunday. What does she say?

11
00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:52.890
Co robiłeś w weekend?

12
00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:57.450
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

13
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.010
Co robiłeś w weekend?

14
00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:07.450
Kasia stayed at home and read. What does she say?

15
00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:13.330
Ja byłam w domu i czytałam książkę.

16
00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:17.890
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

17
00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.570
Ja byłam w domu i czytałam książkę.

18
00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:29.210
A man says: yesterday I was at the cinema.

19
00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.690
Wczoraj byłem w kinie.

20
00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:38.250
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

21
00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.530
Wczoraj byłem w kinie.

